# summary: the store: containers declared as records, their schema-checked records, get, list, put, set, delete, check, and search
# version: 1.0.0
# description:
# The store module is the free container module: every workspace has it. A container
# is declared as one record of the builtin containers container (a one-line
# description, a minting, and field lines), and its records are written through the
# store's own verbs, each write checked against the declaration, so a workspace keeps
# generic data with no module of its own.
